          "step": 5,
          "fact": "The TizinGrammar_Expert agent confirmed the accuracy of the translation based on verification and expert confirmation, then issued a TERMINATE signal."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "judge": "MAS_COMPLEXITY_JUDGE",
      "facts": [
