          "step": 1,
          "fact": "The system involves three distinct agents: TizinGrammar_Expert, Tizin_Translation_Expert, and Verification_Expert."
        },
        {
          "step": 2,
          "fact": "The Tizin_Translation_Expert agent performs the core translation task based on the input from TizinGrammar_Expert."
        },
        {
          "step": 3,
          "fact": "The Verification_Expert agent acts as a quality control step, reviewing the translation provided by the Tizin_Translation_Expert."
        },
        {
          "step": 5,
          "fact": "The TizinGrammar_Expert agent, initially setting up the task, also serves to conclude the process after verification."
